        "name": "AW2 Header",
        "options": {
          "markdown": "# Advanced Workshop #2 \u2014 Observability Cloud\n### What Splunk Enterprise can't show natively, from the same failures\n\nThis dashboard covers the three things the correlation story in the Splunk Enterprise capstone dashboard points back out to: **APM service health & traces**, **real browser (RUM) user data**, and **AlwaysOn continuous Profiling status**. Same failures, different angle.\n\n**Set the `Service` / `Environment` / `RUM Application` dashboard variables above to your own workshop identifiers** (e.g. `wsuser07-k8s-petclinic-...`) \u2014 every panel below re-scopes automatically; nothing here is hardcoded to one participant's data.\n\n**Build v1 (2026-08-21)**",
          "type": "Text"
        },
        "packageSpecifications": "",
        "programText": "",
        "relatedDetectorIds": [],
        "tags": []
      }
